{
  "label": "Detail Panel",
  "category": "Contact-Setup",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Detail Panel & Audit Trail",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Setiap data kontak memiliki Detail Panel untuk menginspeksi informasi secara lengkap. Detail Panel tersaji dalam format Card View (drawer geser kanan) dan Table View (sidebar permanen 22rem), masing-masing dipisahkan ke dalam tab General dan History.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab General: Identitas & Metadata Kontak",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu kontak pada daftar utama untuk membuka Detail Panel.\n• Pada Card View, panel samping terbagi atas:\n  - **Contact Identity (Kiri/Atas)**: Menampilkan nama lengkap kontak, sistem ID, serta tombol tindakan cepat **Edit Contact** dan **Delete Contact**.\n  - **Contact Metadata (Kanan)**: Menyajikan Recipient ID, First Name, Last Name, dan Platform.\n  - **Contact Value (Bawah)**: Box monospace bergaris putus-putus yang menampilkan alamat kontak yang dituju.\n• Pada Table View, Detail Panel tersemat sebagai sidebar permanen dengan lebar tetap `22rem` di sisi kanan halaman.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fff;width:520px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#2563eb;border:1px solid #2563eb;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">History</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;min-height:220px;\"><div style=\"width:190px;padding:18px;background:#f8fafc;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,#2563eb,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Contact Identity</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.2;\">John Doe</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;\">Recipient Info</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(37,99,235,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.15);color:#2563eb;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">Edit Contact</button><button style=\"padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:#ef4444;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">Delete Contact</button></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Contact Metadata</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Recipient ID</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#24</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Platform</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Email</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">First Name</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">John</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Last Name</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Doe</span></div></div><div style=\"border-top:1px dashed #cbd5e1;padding-top:10px;margin-top:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Contact Value</div><div style=\"border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;background:#fafafa;font-family:monospace;font-size:9.5px;color:#334155;\">john.doe@email.com</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab History: Kronologis & Fullscreen Timeline",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **History** merekam riwayat audit perubahan data secara kronologis dari yang terbaru.\n• Log memuat:\n  - **Initiator**: Email user administrator pelaksana perubahan.\n  - **Timestamp**: Waktu eksekusi aksi.\n  - **Status**: Status penyelesaian perubahan (Success/Failed).\n  - **Message**: Rincian deskriptif perlakuan sistem terhadap data.\n• Klik tombol **Expand Timeline** di pojok kanan atas untuk memunculkan modal popup fullscreen guna meninjau audit trail secara menyeluruh.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.12);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #7c3aed;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">History</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;\">Expand Timeline</span></div><div style=\"padding:14px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;padding-left:16px;border-left:2px solid #e9d5ff;margin-left:6px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-5px;top:2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span>admin@system.com</span><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">15 mins ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Updated contact values.</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:#dcfce7;color:#16a34a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">✓ SUCCESS</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Komparasi Nilai (Previous vs New Value)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Khusus pada **Table View**, ketika log riwayat modifikasi merupakan aktivitas pengeditan data (`Update`), audit log akan menampilkan komparasi data lama dan data baru secara terperinci.\n• Komparasi tersaji dalam dropdown Accordion **Previous Value** (berwarna merah muda) dan **New Value** (berwarna biru).\n• Dropdown Accordion memaparkan perbedaan properti spesifik yang diubah, seperti pergeseran *First Name*, *Last Name*, *Platform*, atau *Contact Value*.\n• Pengecekan ini sangat membantu supervisor atau auditor internal dalam mereview kesesuaian perubahan konfigurasi kontak penerima.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(16,185,129,.12);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#f0fdf4;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#15803d;\">Table Details - History Accordion</div></div><div style=\"padding:14px;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-bottom:6px;\">Update contact setup details</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #fee2e2;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span>Previous Value</span><span>▼</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-size:8px;color:#7f1d1d;font-family:monospace;background:#fff;\">contactValue: old@email.com</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span>New Value</span><span>▼</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-size:8px;color:#1e3a8a;font-family:monospace;background:#fff;\">contactValue: new.john@email.com</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
